in the Eastern District of Virginia,

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:13.450
you're likely not going to testify on your own behalf, which, of course,

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:17.650
is prejudicial against you even when it's not supposed to be.

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:20.930
And you've got a jury that's stacked against you.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.820
You have no choice.

