the deference they get with the courts, financing, meaning endless amount

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.980
of taxpayer money, the staff they have.

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:44.060
That's right. Nobody can beat, you know, nobody.

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:47.300
It's very, very difficult to beat the government.

